:: Lake Mason Pretend
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

You smile at <<him>>, and force your expression into something bland and innocent.

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"빗속에서요?" 당신이 말한다. "저도 좋아해요."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"There's nothing wrong with that," you say. "Swimming in the rain can be lovely."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	"In the rain?" you say. "Honestly, it's kind of gorgeous."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"It's fine," you say. "Swimming like that sounds freeing."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"If that's your big secret, don't worry," you say. "I've seen worse."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"빗속에서 수영하는 게 그렇게 이상한 건 아니잖아요." 당신이 말한다. "저도 좋아해요. 상쾌하잖아요."
<<else>>
	"걱정 마세요." 당신이 말한다. "저도 빗속에서 수영하는 거 좋아해요."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> blinks at you, confused for just a moment. "Th-thank you for understanding," <<he>> says, still hiding <<himself>> beneath the water. "I need to get back to my laps. Keep practising, you've shown promising skill."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Lake Depths]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

